1
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,297
At night, a sound leaves
me unable to sleep.

2
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:15,097
There seems to be more
stray cats and dogs now.

3
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,517
Grandfather went for a
walk and has yet to return.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,160
The nearby forest suddenly fell silent.

5
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,820
For a few days now,

6
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:25,317
the livestock have been afraid of
something and it's affecting their health.

7
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,988
It seems to be happening
all over the place.

8
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:30,990
Wait

9
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,317
That's similar to what happened
in the Forest of the Beast?

10
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:39,157
If the enemy has already encroached
this deep into the country!

11
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,157
All who use Search and Uncover!

12
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:44,497
You need to form a network and
dispatch to these areas now!

13
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:47,197
Also, call on the Six Sovereigns!

14
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,457
This is urgent!

15
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:52,040
All of them? Really?
Yes! Hurry! Do it now!

16
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:57,291
Why did I not take notice of this earlier?

17
00:00:57,820 --> 00:01:01,057
What is this are those
bastards of the magical

18
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:04,257
empire really going
this far what did we do

19
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,117
to provoke such actions
do they really want

20
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,906
into the dungeons so
badly they resort to this

21
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:13,220
countless lives will be
caught in the light of fire

22
00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:20,257
it's as if their only
desire their only purpose

23
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:23,380
is coming into our
realm just to destroy it

24
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,270
Thank you.

25
00:03:00,220 --> 00:03:03,017
It's a good thing we got a
little money in the end, huh?

26
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:04,240
You got that right.

27
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,680
Good grief.

28
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,901
I guess I'll do you a favor then.

29
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,830
What's this?

30
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,334
It's in celebration of your first hunt.

31
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,900
Go on now, take it.

32
00:03:14,060 --> 00:03:15,000
Are you sure?

33
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:17,077
Yeah, yeah, don't worry about it.

34
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,572
One goblin only gets you so much anyways.

35
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:23,177
Food somehow tastes better
after taking on a mission.

36
00:03:23,260 --> 00:03:24,090
Sure does.

37
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:30,540
Okay, so how long is this girl
going to be sticking around?

38
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:33,432
Her folks must be worried sick about her.

39
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,820
Thanks so much for the meal.

40
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:41,397
Now then, I think I'll head back to my
home for the day and check on a few things.

41
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:42,310
Oh, great.

42
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:43,950
Is that okay?

43
00:03:44,033 --> 00:03:45,180
Instructor? Of course.

44
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,497
That's quite all right.

45
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,521
You were a really big help today.

46
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:54,104
Please I absolutely look forward to assisting
you again as long as you'll have me.

47
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:56,672
I've been looking everywhere for you Lynn

48
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,510
Rain

49
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,030
Sir nor

50
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:04,397
Sorry for the sudden request,

51
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:06,717
but would you do me the
service of taking my

52
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,717
sister to the Mountain
District tomorrow morning,

53
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,630
huh?

54
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:13,740
Me I can give you a
carriage and an escort.

55
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:17,657
I'm sorry I'm not able to give
you any more details right now,

56
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:19,317
but it would be of great help to me.

57
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:20,230
I see.

58
00:04:20,313 --> 00:04:22,917
Sounds like I'll need to
pack up for this journey.

59
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,817
We will pay you well
and cover your expenses.

60
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:28,606
Please sir, you are the only
person I can trust with this task.

61
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:35,398
And here we are, taking on
a quest through the guild.

62
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:40,037
Master said to kick back and relax
while on the way there, and well,

63
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,649
that sounds like a
pretty sweet deal to me.

64
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:46,600
But to be honest,

65
00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:51,297
the real reason I accepted the task is
because I've never been on a carriage before,

66
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:53,439
and I wanted to see what it's like.

67
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:06,397
For somebody like me, who's
never really left the capital,

68
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,951
this is all the payment I could ever need.

69
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:13,296
And if I'm lucky, I'll be able to go
to a bunch of other countries too.

70
00:05:15,780 --> 00:05:16,662
What's up, Lin?

71
00:05:16,780 --> 00:05:18,017
Don't you want to see the scenery?

72
00:05:18,100 --> 00:05:20,397
I mean, it's just about
time for the wheat harvest.

73
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:23,186
We sure do live in a
land of plenty, don't we?

74
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,720
Uh, okay.

75
00:05:27,820 --> 00:05:32,560
One day, I want to become a normal
adventurer and do these journeys on my own.

76
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:36,997
I'm sorry my brother dropped this
request on you all of a sudden.

77
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,297
Ah, don't worry about it.

78
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:40,337
I am getting paid for coming along,

79
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:43,538
and I owe you for the goblin
hunt we just did anyway.

80
00:05:46,420 --> 00:05:47,580
First things first,

81
00:05:47,860 --> 00:05:50,197
you will travel northwest
of the capital via

82
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,757
carriage towards the
mountain district of Tauros.

83
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:55,664
There, I need you to just
sit tight for a while.

84
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:02,740
After that, but only if
everything seems to be copacetic,

85
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:06,920
you'll cross the mountain to
the holy theocracy of Mithra.

86
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:11,117
Are you really okay with me just
sort of coming along for the ride?

87
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,440
Think of it as like a vacation.

88
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:16,320
That is, if nothing happens.

89
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:22,577
I hope that everyone back home is
going to be okay while we're away.

90
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:23,490
Don't worry.

91
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:25,340
They'll be fine.

92
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:28,080
This is all just part of the plan.

93
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:29,290
What was that?

94
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,541
Prince himself told me to
keep my orders a secret.

95
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:41,160
In the near future, the capital
will fall into unprecedented crisis.

96
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:47,300
Should you receive report of
its destruction, at that time,

97
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:52,033
take Lin and together with Ser Noir
flee to Mithra as quietly as possible.

98
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:55,700
Does Lady Lindbergh know of this, sir?

99
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,180
She does not.

100
00:06:57,640 --> 00:07:01,360
If I were to tell her, she would
surely refuse and stay behind.

101
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:05,720
But if there's an emergency, I
will be nowhere near the castle.

102
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:08,097
This is of utmost importance.

103
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:11,004
You are the only one I
can trust with this task.

104
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:15,437
Ines, it is your duty to
get her somewhere safe.

105
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,980
I'm counting on you.

106
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,398
Yes, your highness.

107
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:29,600
I'm sorry.

108
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:30,970
Hmm?

109
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:35,400
I must apologize that you've
become caught up in this.

110
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:37,597
You make a simple trip sound so serious.

111
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:41,140
And I gotta say, you haven't
been looking too well.

112
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,297
Are you sure you're feeling okay?

113
00:07:43,380 --> 00:07:45,733
I'm just a little troubled by something.

114
00:07:46,820 --> 00:07:50,291
But keeping you safe is another
one of my responsibilities.

115
00:07:50,420 --> 00:07:51,640
You need not worry.

116
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:55,181
Thanks, but I'm not really
worried about anything.

117
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:58,257
I'm sure I can protect
myself if something comes up.

118
00:07:58,340 --> 00:08:00,516
And can always run away if I need to.

119
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,660
You won't need to do that. Oh.

120
00:08:03,620 --> 00:08:04,800
I have a shield.

121
00:08:05,060 --> 00:08:06,140
I can protect you.

122
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,737
You have a shield?

123
00:08:08,820 --> 00:08:09,920
But where is it?

124
00:08:10,100 --> 00:08:12,276
I haven't seen you carrying anything.

125
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:15,600
In my case, I don't
need something to carry.

126
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:19,560
In fact, it's better in many
ways if I have nothing. Huh?

127
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:23,620
It will be easier if I just show you.

128
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,460
Now, Divine Shield!

129
00:08:28,500 --> 00:08:29,330
Whoa!

130
00:08:29,413 --> 00:08:30,243
That's amazing!

131
00:08:30,326 --> 00:08:32,201
I've never seen anything like it.

132
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:37,406
Listen, if anything happens to us, hide
yourself behind this barricade of light.

133
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:40,191
Neither weapons nor magic can get through.

134
00:08:40,900 --> 00:08:41,730
Yeah, sure thing.

135
00:08:41,813 --> 00:08:43,347
Don't have to tell me twice.

136
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,120
According to Lin,

137
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:49,634
the guy with the spear who let me
train with him at the practice grounds.

138
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:53,217
I think it was Gil? Phil?

139
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:54,460
No, Armadil?

140
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:59,257
Anyway, he's so great, he was able to
bring down a dragon all on his own.

141
00:08:59,340 --> 00:09:01,980
And she is no less powerful than he is.

142
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,577
They're on a whole
different level than me.

143
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:07,307
I get into trouble with
just a single goblin.

144
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:10,540
That is a remarkable talent. Seriously.

145
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,240
Talent, huh?

146
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:21,200
Shortly after being
taken into an orphanage,

147
00:09:21,340 --> 00:09:25,060
I noticed there was a mysterious
power growing within me.

148
00:09:27,140 --> 00:09:28,557
Inus, what's that thing?

149
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:30,180
It sure is pretty!

150
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,030
Ow!

151
00:09:34,113 --> 00:09:35,120
He caught me!

152
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:38,200
Someone, call Director Save!

153
00:09:42,940 --> 00:09:46,460
I healed her, so you need
not worry anymore, my dear.

154
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:50,600
Now, show me the power
you were using earlier.

155
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:02,249
You have a gift that has been
given to you from the heavens.

156
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:03,380
A gift?

157
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:06,680
And a historically rare one at that.

158
00:10:06,980 --> 00:10:10,392
It could become a sharpened
blade able to cut anyone down,

159
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:13,344
or even a shield to protect
against adversaries.

160
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:18,275
Depending on how you use it, it could
even annihilate an entire country.

161
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,560
Ines, was it?

162
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:24,520
It's all right.

163
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:27,845
You can start learning
to use it beginning now.

164
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,860
Okay, I'm ready now!

165
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:35,840
After that, I was taken in by
the Sovereign Shield Dandog,

166
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,412
and I learned from the Six
Sovereigns how to use my power.

167
00:10:40,260 --> 00:10:44,800
Even so, I could not quell the fear
that I would hurt someone again.

168
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:50,157
Naturally, I started to put
distance between myself and others,

169
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,417
and I became detached.

170
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:54,420
I drifted away from everyone.

171
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:57,620
At least, I thought I had.

172
00:10:58,640 --> 00:11:01,581
I would like to have your
name, if you don't mind.

173
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,580
I'm Noor.

174
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,710
Noor!

175
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:08,000
I knew that name very well.

176
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,380
Never get distracted.

177
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:28,568
Dandalg was my foster father, and the
instructor I held in the highest regard.

178
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:34,320
He was always teaching me, and
I heard that name from him.

179
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:36,237
It never seems to end, does it?

180
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:38,557
The onslaught shows no sign of relenting.

181
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:41,581
Yes, I fear the soldiers
are beginning to fatigue.

182
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,300
It's heavy times like these.

183
00:11:44,660 --> 00:11:46,719
I wish that Noor were still around.

184
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,700
That name again.

185
00:11:49,260 --> 00:11:51,080
Oh, forget that. Never mind.

186
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:53,760
We must be steadfast. Come along.

187
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:57,600
Noor, someone worthy of
respect by my father.

188
00:11:58,640 --> 00:12:01,260
Even though I have been right here.

189
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:05,340
My yearning for his
acknowledgement grew inside me.

190
00:12:05,860 --> 00:12:07,420
I still feel it.

191
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:11,700
I am somehow still envious
of a man I have never met.

192
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:19,260
And now it's gotten worse, ever
since he appeared before me.

193
00:12:30,020 --> 00:12:31,100
But no.

194
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:34,780
No, I cannot allow my
feelings to cloud my judgment.

195
00:12:35,140 --> 00:12:37,480
I am the shield of the Clay's kingdom.

196
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:42,200
I protect Lady Lindbergh
with my very life.

197
00:12:42,620 --> 00:12:43,980
That is my duty.

198
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:50,640
What's that?

199
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,697
There's a path in the wheat fields.

200
00:12:52,780 --> 00:12:54,780
But it doesn't really look right.

201
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:57,557
Sir Noor, something wrong.

202
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,940
I don't know.

203
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:03,336
I thought I saw something strange
over there cutting through the field.

204
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,160
Stop, Inez!

205
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:17,780
I'm coming!

206
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:34,580
So it begins.

207
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:36,350
Reporting in!

208
00:13:37,340 --> 00:13:39,657
Several beasts have
appeared around the capital.

209
00:13:39,740 --> 00:13:43,657
The Warrior Corps are handling it, but we
don't have enough soldiers for them all.

210
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:47,557
Have the Swordsman Company block the
roads immediately to fend them off.

211
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:50,540
Instruct that all citizens
be evacuated. Also,

212
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:53,317
tell the Secret Corps and the
Hunter Corps to send as many as

213
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:56,317
possible to fight the Monster Horde
and help stave off casualties.

214
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:59,420
Do not allow a single
citizen to fall. Right.

215
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:04,300
That damned Eridus.

216
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:09,356
There will come a day in your future
when you shall regret those words.

217
00:14:09,780 --> 00:14:14,160
He has finally come to make good on
his threats he boasted about, has he?

218
00:14:14,380 --> 00:14:16,477
I'm afraid this is just the beginning.

219
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,854
I do not believe it will end with this.

220
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,040
Suppose not.

221
00:14:21,860 --> 00:14:22,980
The Sovereigns?

222
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,887
We have dispatched them all.

223
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:28,167
Monsters have been seen
in various locations.

224
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:31,264
And at each one, we had
no choice but to engage.

225
00:14:42,340 --> 00:14:44,300
Defend this place at all costs!

226
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:46,324
Don't leave a single one alive!

227
00:15:10,820 --> 00:15:12,920
Our forces have been spread thin.

228
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,478
That's unfortunate.

229
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,270
Yes.

230
00:15:17,353 --> 00:15:18,440
But Lin is safe.

231
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:21,485
She should be deep within
the mountains by now.

232
00:15:26,660 --> 00:15:28,220
I have to kill them all.

233
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:30,040
I have to kill them all.

234
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,740
No, I don't believe it.

235
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,660
A black death dragon.

236
00:15:47,180 --> 00:15:50,239
Why is such a vicious
creature in a place like this?

237
00:15:53,340 --> 00:15:54,197
Hold on!

238
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,280
That's...

239
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,140
Fairy!

240
00:16:19,060 --> 00:16:20,780
Did you not notice?

241
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:24,828
We did not see that boy
in the field before.

242
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:28,157
It was only when you used your
Uncover skill that he appeared,

243
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:30,260
along with the Black Death Dragon.

244
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:35,137
You mean that kid is...

245
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:36,460
Demon folk?

246
00:16:37,740 --> 00:16:38,570
Yes.

247
00:16:38,653 --> 00:16:39,777
You've heard of them, haven't you?

248
00:16:39,860 --> 00:16:40,690
I have.

249
00:16:41,740 --> 00:16:43,916
They appear to be the same as humans,

250
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:46,517
but they are demi-humans
who have the special

251
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:49,659
ability of establishing a
mental bond with monsters.

252
00:16:50,780 --> 00:16:51,610
If anything,

253
00:16:51,820 --> 00:16:54,097
they are closer to beasts
than they are with humans,

254
00:16:54,180 --> 00:16:57,121
and they are considered
aberrations and dangerous.

255
00:16:57,940 --> 00:17:01,997
There are records from 200 years ago
